        <p>Just Published. An Illustrated Treatise by W. H. Veno, KS.Sc. (Loud.), explaining in detail the home treatment of all forms of Piles and kindred troubles showing bow these dangerous afflictions may be easily and speedily cured, thus obviating any necessity for an operation. For thirty days only this instructive book will be sent free to all sufferers, and applications should bb made at onoe to W. H. VENO, (Dept. P. 303), Cedar- street, Manchester.</p>
